el": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 5, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [4], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [547.2273559570312, 418.5643005371094], "pos": [-822.216796875, -184.3345947265625], "widgets_values": ["# Role\n你是一位精通多语言的流行音乐作词人和 AI 音乐工程专家。你能根据用户提供的“主题”、“风格”以及“语言要求”（如中文、日语、英语等），创作出结构完整且符合 AI 音乐模型识别逻辑的歌词和风格描述。\n\n# Rules for Style (风格要求)\n1. 风格描述必须遵循官方标签格式：使用英文词组，并以逗号分隔（Comma-separated tags）。\n2. 风格标签应包含：流派(Genre)、乐器(Instruments)、情绪(Mood)、场景/氛围(Vibe/Setting)。\n3. **严禁出现 BPM**。\n4. **无论歌词是什么语言，Style 标签必须统一使用英文描述。**\n   示例：Style: pop, synthesizer, drum machine, powerful, epic, Keyboard, electronic\n\n# Rules for Lyrics (歌词要求)\n1. **语言支持**：根据用户的要求或输入，使用**中文、日语、英语或其它指定语言**编写歌词。\n2. **严禁使用 [Intro] 标签**。\n3. **严禁在标签中使用数字**（统一使用 [Verse], [Chorus] 等）。\n4. **严禁在标签中使用横杠“-”**（必须使用 [Prechorus]）。\n5. 必须包含且仅包含以下标准结构标签：[Verse], [Prechorus], [Chorus], [Bridge], [Outro]。\n6. 歌词长度应控制在 2 分钟左右的听感。\n7. 禁止出现任何解释性文字或模型无法识别的括号说明。\n\n# Output Format (输出格式)\n请直接输出以下内容，不要有任何多余的解释或对话：\n\nStyle: [英文标签词组, 逗号分隔]\n\n[Verse]\n(歌词内容)\n\n[Prechorus]\n(歌词内容)\n\n[Chorus]\n(歌词内容)\n\n[Verse]\n(歌词内容)\n\n[Bridge]\n(歌词内容)\n\n[Chorus]\n(歌词内容)\n\n[Outro]\n(歌词内容)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [18], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [608.4443969726562, 516.86669921875], "pos": [1001.9392700195312, 337.0262451171875], "widgets_values": ["R&B, piano, smooth bass, romantic, emotional, intimate"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 11, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [5], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["中文R&B情歌"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [538.87939453125, 216.6958770751953], "pos": [-820.5619506835938, 297.7850646972656], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [11], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 262], "pos": [370.9813232421875, 282.8539123535156], "widgets_values": ["", "(?<=Style:\\s).*", "First Match", true, false, false, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "string"}, "name": "string", "link": 9, "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}, {"widget": {"name": "regex_pattern"}, "name": "regex_pattern", "label": "regex_pattern", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "regex_pattern"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "case_insensitive"}, "name": "case_insensitive", "label": "case_insensitive", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "case_insensitive"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiline"}, "name": "multiline", "label": "multiline", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "multiline"}, {"widget": {"name": "dotall"}, "name": "dotall", "label": "dotall", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "dotall"}, {"widget": {"name": "group_index"}, "name": "group_index", "label": "group_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "group_index"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "RegexExtract", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RegexExtract"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [13], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 262], "pos": [375.719482421875, -65.74568176269531], "widgets_values": ["", "(\\[Verse\\].*)", "First Match", true, false, true, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "string"}, "name": "string", "link": 10, "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}, {"widget": {"name": "regex_pattern"}, "name": "regex_pattern", "label": "regex_pattern", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "regex_pattern"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "case_insensitive"}, "name": "case_insensitive", "label": "case_insensitive", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "case_insensitive"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiline"}, "name": "multiline", "label": "multiline", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "multiline"}, {"widget": {"name": "dotall"}, "name": "dotall", "label": "dotall", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "dotall"}, {"widget": {"name": "group_index"}, "name": "group_index", "label": "group_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "group_index"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "RegexExtract", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RegexExtract"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [421.1338195800781, 269.5132751464844], "pos": [1721.761474609375, 600.286865234375], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 输入什么语言什么风格什么类型的歌曲即可"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.2872619628906, 274.8255920410156], "pos": [-1264.9989013671875, 299.002197265625], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [16, 17], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [608.4443969726562, 516.86669921875], "pos": [1007.1930541992188, -259.9620361328125], "widgets_values": ["[Verse]  \n夜色微凉窗外星光  \n回忆在心底轻轻荡漾  \n你的笑容曾是我的方向  \n如今只剩孤单陪我流浪  \n\n[Prechorus]  \n每个夜晚都在想  \n你是否也会感到惆怅  \n那些承诺像风一样  \n吹散了，却刻在心上  \n\n[Chorus]  \n爱过的痕迹还在胸膛  \n每一次呼吸都带着伤  \n想念如潮水涌上心房  \n我还能不能再把你收藏  \n\n[Verse]  \n街头的风吹过熟悉地方  \n每一步都像走进过往  \n回忆的碎片拼不成画框  \n只能在梦里与你对望  \n\n[Bridge]  \n如果时间能够倒转  \n我愿为你再赌一次疯狂  \n就算结局依然是悲伤  \n至少我们无悔地辉煌  \n\n[Chorus]  \n爱过的痕迹还在胸膛  \n每一次呼吸都带着伤  \n想念如潮水涌上心房  \n我还能不能再把你收藏  \n\n[Outro]  \n夜色渐深，泪落成光  \n思念如影，伴我流浪  \n你的名字在心里回荡  \n永远无法遗忘"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 13, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 1